  "html": "<div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col col-8\"><h2>Propane System</h2><figure><img src=\"/uploads/2016/07/HPFP-Propane-System-b.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><div class=\"center\">\n\t\t\t<ul>\n<li>Compact System with full recycle can be installed in small labs</li>\n<li>Integral exhaust hood maintains safe atmosphere</li>\n<li>Integrated sensor for early detection and control of flammable vapors</li>\n<li>Constructed to NFPA hazard classification standards</li>\n<li>Stainless steel construction allows use of multiple working fluids – CO2/butane/DME in addition to propane</li>\n</ul>\n</div></div><div class=\"col col-4\">\n\t\t\t<nav class=\"side-nav\"><h3 class=\"widget-title\">Liquified Gasses</h3><ul><li><a href=\"/supercritical-fluid-processing/liquefied-gases/butane-pilot-plant/\">Butane Pilot Plant</a></li><li><a href=\"/supercritical-fluid-processing/liquefied-gases/dme-system-for-fiber-recycling/\">DME System for Fiber Recycling</a></li><li class=\"current\"><a href=\"/supercritical-fluid-processing/liquefied-gases/propane-system/\">Propane System</a></li></ul></nav>\n</div></div><h3>Machine Images</h3><div class=\"gallery\"><a href=\"/uploads/2016/07/HPFP-Propane-System-b-914x1024.jpg\"><img src=\"/uploads/2016/07/HPFP-Propane-System-b-268x300.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"268\" height=\"300\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><a href=\"/uploads/2016/07/HPFP-Propane-System-a-665x1024.jpg\"><img src=\"/uploads/2016/07/HPFP-Propane-System-a-195x300.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"195\" height=\"300\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div>"
